WEBVTT

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:06.970
<i>Thinking back now,</i>

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:10.420
<i>how many times have I come here</i> <i>since that day?</i>

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:15.610
<i>I was the only one in this town,</i> <i>this country, ...</i>

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:17.980
<i>no, this planet</i>

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:22.220
<i>who loved my girlfriend, Chise.</i>

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:28.350
<i>This was our special place.</i>

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:33.770
<i>It was here, on that day...</i>

00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:36.660
<i>that our love first began.</i>

00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:45.640
<i>In a country town like this,</i> <i>there's not much to do.</i>

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:49.910
<i>And we knew nothing of our futures.</i>

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:53.950
<i>But one thing was certain.</i>

00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:08.030
Shuji...

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:10.500
I'm sorry, Mom.

00:01:11.410 --> 00:01:13.940
I can't stay here with you.

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:16.700
I'm in love with someone.

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:19.510
I promised her...

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:21.450
that I'd go away with her.

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:26.850
Shuji...

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:29.060
Then get going, Shuji.

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.420
I'll take care of your mother. Don't worry.

00:01:40.270 --> 00:01:41.700
Good luck.

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:57.280
Don't worry about Shuji. He's all grown up now.

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:02.720
All his friends in the picture are gone now.

00:02:03.530 --> 00:02:05.580
Such good kids...

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:08.560
they went through so much.

00:02:09.430 --> 00:02:11.760
And now...

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:12.800
It's alright.

00:02:13.430 --> 00:02:17.840
Times like this can't last forever.

00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:21.670
Shuji's generation...

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:24.230
is just beginning.

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:28.240
It's their time, their world.

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:30.620
You know, Mother...

00:02:31.090 --> 00:02:36.340
Our Shuji's grown to be a fine man.

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:43.090
Shu...ji!

00:02:43.900 --> 00:02:45.530
Shuji!

00:02:56.540 --> 00:03:02.410
<i>That day, we made love</i> <i>again and again.</i>

00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:07.180
<i>When we were spent, we slept...</i>

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:12.060
<i>our bodies pressed together</i> <i>as if we were one.</i>

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:15.790
<i>That was a part of love...</i>

00:03:16.350 --> 00:03:17.960
<i>It was everything,</i>

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:20.260
<i>and also its end.</i>

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:37.180
"First Time Memorial Chise ♥ Shuji"

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:41.320
202 BC: The Battle of Zama

00:03:42.190 --> 00:03:46.920
73 BC: Spartacus' Revolt

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:49.190
66 BC -

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:50.160
Chise...

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:52.560
'Morning.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:54.760
What is it?

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:57.160
Shuji, do you remember,

00:03:57.310 --> 00:04:01.070
all those ancient prophecies about the end of the world,

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:04.310
and the people who predicted it?

00:04:04.980 --> 00:04:09.850
When I was little I really believed them.

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:15.350
I used to go off by myself and cry...

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:19.620
thinking I would die as a teenager.

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:26.000
I wish I could go back in time and tell that little girl,

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:29.630
that the world would be fine...

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:31.800
and lie.

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:33.610
Chise...

00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:39.480
Then I wouldn't have had to cry so much,

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:42.110
and be so scared.

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:55.390
9 AD: The Battle of Teutoburg

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:59.260
<i>Again Chise started reciting the events</i>

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:01.860
<i>of the world's history,</i>

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:05.640
<i>as if she were singing...</i>

00:05:05.940 --> 00:05:07.670
<i>its death song.</i>

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:14.480
<i>The timeline of history,</i> <i>the one subject she was good at.</i>

00:05:19.350 --> 00:05:25.260
Shuji, I didn't really want to remember you.

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:27.390
It's true.

00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:30.050
It's true.

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:31.220
Chise...

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:37.500
If I'd stayed a weapon, and never became human again,

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:43.440
I wouldn't have had to suffer and feel sad.

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:48.010
And even if I were the only one left,

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:51.750
I wouldn't have felt lonely at all.

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:57.150
They're coming.

00:05:57.280 --> 00:05:58.060
Chise!

00:06:00.930 --> 00:06:03.990
You know, Shuji,

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:06.230
I wanted to die

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:08.390
with you watching over me.

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:16.670
Dummy! It can be helped!

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:18.010
Damn it!

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:20.480
Cut it out!

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:25.070
Shuji, I was hoping...

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:29.650
that love would save me finally.

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:35.410
But it didn't...

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:38.690
make me feel better at all.

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:40.530
I know you're there!

00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:44.100
She's alive.

00:06:44.810 --> 00:06:46.640
Chise's still alive.

00:06:47.310 --> 00:06:48.540
She's alive.

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:57.320
You showed me ecstasy. You told me to live, and fight

00:06:57.900 --> 00:07:00.190
and love 'till the end.

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:02.690
Chise.

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:07.250
You're the one who told me to live.

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:08.420
That's why...

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:13.370
I want you by my side when the end comes.

00:07:27.850 --> 00:07:28.740
Chise...

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:36.650
I'm sorry, Shuji. We're together at last...

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:38.470
and it's all over.

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:39.880
Over?

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:46.300
I'm sorry, Shuji. It's too late. The world is ending.

00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:53.100
I know it's kind of a shock for you, all this,

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:55.120
but it's the truth.

00:07:55.880 --> 00:08:00.250
Here in this town you wouldn't know it,

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:04.140
but the other side of the world is completely destroyed.

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:06.480
The people and the planet itself.

00:08:08.950 --> 00:08:11.350
And soon, this town will be too.

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:16.230
Chise!

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:23.260
The people coming care only about their own nation's survival.

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:25.620
There's no stopping them.

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:30.370
They know I'm here.

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:38.690
But they're fools. The world's finished, no matter what happens to me.

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:43.720
It's so stupid.

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:45.280
They'll fight 'till the end.

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:49.260
They just can't help it.

00:08:51.930 --> 00:08:55.230
Next will come an earthquake that will shake the whole planet.

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:58.770
Shuji, I'm sorry.

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:00.670
No matter what I do,

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:04.680
it's almost over. The end is coming soon.

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:09.080
It can't be helped.

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:13.950
Humanity made its choice.

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:20.720
I've known this for a while now. So have the people in charge.

00:09:21.260 --> 00:09:23.820
They struggled with it.

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:27.230
There's no hope for anyone now.

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:30.800
So I was thinking,

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:33.530
I should kill you,

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:38.810
and everyone else in this town, everyone I love,

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:43.480
quickly, just before the end,

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:48.010
so you wouldn't have to suffer.

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:52.850
That's the one thing I can do for you.

00:10:03.550 --> 00:10:06.870
But you... but you made me...

00:10:07.810 --> 00:10:12.400
Now what will I do, Shuji?

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:18.460
Chise...

00:10:18.620 --> 00:10:22.230
I'll stay and watch over you.

00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:26.920
I won't go anywhere. I won't leave you alone.

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:31.260
So please don't say...

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:34.480
don't say...

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:36.710
that it's over...

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:40.470
until the very end!

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:47.100
All right. I'll defend this town and its people.

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:52.020
I'll keep them alive until the very end!

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:10.430
But, I'm a weapon.

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:13.470
All I can do is fight.

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:18.430
I might end up killing you, too.

00:11:19.850 --> 00:11:20.750
If that happens...

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:22.180
Dummy!

00:11:22.520 --> 00:11:23.570
Shuji...

00:11:23.650 --> 00:11:24.850
I'll be waiting here.

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:28.050
I'm off...

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:20.530
Dad...

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:22.200
Mom...

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:24.210
Everyone, I'm sorry!

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:38.250
Dad! Mom!

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:42.620
<i>I'm sorry! Everyone, I'm sorry!</i>

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:46.770
Chise!

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:05.550
A tsunami...

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:12.790
No more!

00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:16.120
Shuji, I'm sorry!

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:17.190
Chise!

00:13:18.120 --> 00:13:19.700
I can't protect you!

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:23.560
Shuji, sorry!

00:13:25.190 --> 00:13:26.210
Shuji!

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:28.710
I can't stand it!

00:13:29.140 --> 00:13:31.230
I don't want <i>you</i>  to suffer!

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:38.050
Chise...

00:13:39.970 --> 00:13:42.340
Let me put you at peace!

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:44.150
Chise... Chise!

00:13:44.890 --> 00:13:49.060
I don't want to die! No one does!

00:13:56.550 --> 00:13:58.430
Dad! Mom!

00:14:03.010 --> 00:14:03.910
Akemi!

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:12.710
Fools!

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:17.060
We were born to live!

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:20.320
Chise!

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:40.810
Is anyone there?

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:43.380
Hey!

00:14:47.250 --> 00:14:48.590
A dream?

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:52.820
Is this a dream?

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:57.930
I don't like this at all.

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:02.400
Why is it only me?

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:04.860
There's no one here.

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:08.000
No one left...

00:15:08.780 --> 00:15:10.140
Nothing left!

00:15:11.650 --> 00:15:13.610
Nothing!

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:32.760
<i>We left this here as proof.</i>

00:15:36.840 --> 00:15:40.240
<i>We were here for sure.</i>

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:48.380
<i>Small, silly, insignificant,</i> <i>precious evidence we existed.</i>

00:16:17.480 --> 00:16:18.270
Chise...

00:16:21.240 --> 00:16:21.970
Chise!

00:16:23.150 --> 00:16:26.750
Sorry, you did well.

00:16:26.820 --> 00:16:28.410
Was it hard?

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:30.780
You must've been lonely.

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:32.720
It's alright now.

00:16:33.610 --> 00:16:35.590
It's alright now.

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:40.000
I kept my promise, though.

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:43.930
I finally kept a promise to you.

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:46.310
Say, Chise...

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:51.570
We're lovers to the end, aren't we?

00:16:52.550 --> 00:16:56.660
Even after all that's happened...

00:16:57.550 --> 00:16:58.610
You see?

00:16:58.690 --> 00:17:00.740
I'm still choked up over you!

00:17:01.560 --> 00:17:03.080
Listen, Chise!

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:32.140
Are you calling to me, Chise?

00:17:33.050 --> 00:17:33.950
Are you?

00:17:35.670 --> 00:17:38.890
Is that why you said I should stay?

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:43.660
But what's the use saving only me?

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:48.570
Am I to live in a world all alone?

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:54.470
That's right, Chise, I said...

00:17:54.650 --> 00:17:56.340
"I'll stay with you."

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:58.200
I said that.

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:01.410
I told you to live.

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:03.840
I understand.

00:18:10.460 --> 00:18:11.450
Let's live, then.

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:15.980
<i>Shuji,</i>

00:18:16.790 --> 00:18:20.760
<i>I heard your heart...</i>

00:18:21.290 --> 00:18:24.270
<i>It went, "thump, thump."</i>

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:32.570
<i>Shuji, sorry.</i>

00:18:32.650 --> 00:18:36.510
<i>I'm only alive inside you now.</i>

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:38.740
<i>Even that takes all I've got.</i>

00:18:39.990 --> 00:18:42.920
<i>I was able to save you...</i>

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:46.720
<i>but we can't even kiss.</i>

00:18:48.170 --> 00:18:51.730
<i>We can't touch, or make love anymore.</i>

00:18:52.630 --> 00:18:54.790
<i>Sorry, Shuji.</i>

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:58.440
<i>Shuji, what's the matter?</i>

00:19:02.140 --> 00:19:04.540
Dummy! You don't have to apologize.

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:06.580
We're together now.

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:12.370
I'm glad I met you. I'm so happy.

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:17.170
I'm happy we're together like this.

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:21.650
<i>Shuji, I'm sorry.</i>

00:19:21.900 --> 00:19:23.860
Stop apologizing, I said!

00:19:28.910 --> 00:19:29.710
<i>This is Chise.</i>

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:40.110
Wha--?

00:19:42.050 --> 00:19:44.450
But, I'm inside you...

00:19:44.520 --> 00:19:45.170
Chise...

00:19:45.920 --> 00:19:50.120
Am I existing in your heart like this?

00:19:51.190 --> 00:19:53.420
Can you see me?

00:19:53.490 --> 00:19:55.120
Yeah. I see you.

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:56.750
Shuji!

00:19:57.230 --> 00:19:59.100
You're my girlfriend.

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:04.670
Shuji! Shuji!

00:20:04.740 --> 00:20:05.400
Chise!

00:20:05.470 --> 00:20:06.910
Sorry!

00:20:08.280 --> 00:20:09.330
Dummy.

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:13.000
Shuji.

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:13.880
Chise.

00:20:18.090 --> 00:20:22.990
Your heart! I can feel it beating.

00:20:23.460 --> 00:20:25.020
It feels so good!

00:20:26.190 --> 00:20:32.290
There's so much of me left inside you!

00:20:34.030 --> 00:20:35.870
All of this!

00:20:37.470 --> 00:20:43.000
<i>Remembering all we did,</i> <i>carrying our sins with us,</i>

00:20:43.080 --> 00:20:46.840
<i>we will live in atonement until death,</i>

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:52.120
<i>because I'm her's, and she's mine,</i>

00:20:52.190 --> 00:20:56.920
<i>even if our time together</i> <i>seems like just a moment,</i>

00:20:57.090 --> 00:20:59.890
<i>we'll be together, we'll live.</i>

00:21:01.840 --> 00:21:03.560
<i>Chise is cute...</i>

00:21:03.830 --> 00:21:05.230
<i>But slow.</i>

00:21:05.730 --> 00:21:08.220
<i>And small. And timid.</i>

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:09.890
<i>Clumsy, too.</i>

00:21:10.100 --> 00:21:13.770
<i>Her grades are below average,</i> <i>except in history.</i>

00:21:14.320 --> 00:21:15.920
<i>She always says, "I'm sorry."</i>

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:20.710
<i>Her motto is, "I want to be strong."</i>

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:23.310
<i>My girlfriend.</i>

00:21:28.690 --> 00:21:34.650
Say, Chise, has the world really, you know...

00:21:36.030 --> 00:21:40.950
Yeah, it's over. You're the only one left.

00:21:41.380 --> 00:21:42.730
I see.

00:21:46.140 --> 00:21:47.230
Sorry.

00:21:47.710 --> 00:21:48.860
Dummy.

00:21:51.210 --> 00:21:57.410
<i>The sound of the end of the world,</i> <i>I heard it as Chise's heartbeat.</i>

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:05.590
<i>Our voices, and that of the world,</i> <i>raised in its final...</i>

00:22:05.860 --> 00:22:06.600
<i>love song.</i>

00:22:07.120 --> 00:22:11.430
I'm constantly looking back

00:22:11.430 --> 00:22:12.990
<i>We will love.</i>

00:22:13.320 --> 00:22:13.420
Thinking about the time we first met

00:22:14.570 --> 00:22:16.040
<i>We will live.</i>

00:22:16.040 --> 00:22:17.400
Thinking about the time we first met

00:22:17.540 --> 00:22:24.020
Those fun days are now just bitter memories

00:22:25.130 --> 00:22:29.380
Don't let me alone

00:22:29.430 --> 00:22:34.340
Goodbye my beloved,

00:22:34.490 --> 00:22:40.670
I don't want this love of ours to end

00:22:40.800 --> 00:22:46.790
Instead of our love,

00:22:47.040 --> 00:22:54.410
I wish these words of goodbye would disapear

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:19.220
Goodbye my beloved,

00:23:19.440 --> 00:23:25.550
I am still unable to forget about you

00:23:25.660 --> 00:23:36.050
Having all of this end with just a single word of goodbye...

00:23:36.160 --> 00:23:41.720
Fills me with sorrow
